{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56052","headline":"渚宫莫问诗一十五首之十一 · 齐己","name":"渚宫莫问诗一十五首之十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫问休贪恋，浮云逐性情。\n人间高此道，禅外剩他名。\n夏雨松边坐，秋光水畔行。\n更无时忌讳，容易得题成。\n（同前卷五）（按：《全唐诗》卷八四二收此诗缺六字，今重录。\n又《全唐诗》卷八四一收《还族弟卷》第五句缺一字，前引四库本《白莲集》卷四作「诣」，《四部丛刊》本作「苦」。\n卷八四三《闻西蟾从弟卜岩居岳诗有寄》第八句缺一字，四库本《白莲集》卷六作「总」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56052.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56052","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}